## Final acceptance

☐ Component mounts remain targeted.
☐ Native mounts follow the live viewscreen stack.
☐ Registered fullscreen overlays can coexist with native mounts.
☐ Native subject roots remain stable across unrelated top-screen changes.
☐ Genuine subject staleness still fails explicitly.
☐ Borrowed screens and all test-owned state are clean after verification.
